    "title": "Chris Clark Wins Game Day Master Chef 2025 in Olean with Braised Short Ribs - NewsBreak",
    "text": "38 minutes ago Chris Clark with his trophy – you can see his name by his right hand from winning in 2024. Chris Clark of Clark’s Subs took home the title of Game Day Master Chef 2025, winning the crowd over with his braised short ribs served atop creamy mashed potatoes, parsnips and sweet corn. Last year’s champion with Korean pork belly tacos, Clark explained that he wanted something “upscale, yet football friendly” this year. His creation delivered, with attendee Schelin Molica praising the ribs as “very tender and full of flavor.” Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
